# Dance Dance Revolution 3rd Mix (GN887 VER. AAA), Konami 1999: as ddr3mj-boot.his, whose game it is a revision or a sibling of.
# DDR 3rd Mix (System 573): power-on, no inputs. The 573 BIOS runs, finds the
# onboard flash empty and boots the CD, which stops at ERROR 147 until the game
# is installed. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames,
# so HIRAKU's 573 core can be compared with MAME through the BIOS.
game ddr3ma

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 3600 quit
